export anchor MoonPhaseStyle:
    number: 382
    screen: SmartHome
    name: Moon phase
    idea: A calm night sky holds the home, a pale moon and scattered stars over a horizon, the day's energy drawn as a tide with high and low marks, and scenes shown as phases of the moon.
    base: dark
    palette:
        sky: #060a18, page and lower sky
        sky2: #0b1330, top of the sky gradient
        deep: #0d1530, secondary buttons
        line: #253058, rules, panel and phase card edges
        ink: #e8ecf7, text
        mute: #a3acc8, labels, axis and notes
        moon: #f3ecd2, the moon, lit phases, primary button, active scene edge and focus
        onMoon: #1a1608, text on moon
        tide: #7fb5e6, the energy tide line and motion
        star: #cfd8f5, star dots
        warm: #ffbf94, lights on and the alert
        mint: #9be3c8, locked
        rose: #f5b0c0, bedroom cooling
    type:
        High contrast serif for display, Didot, Bodoni 72, Bodoni MT, Big
        Caslon, Book Antiqua, Georgia. Text in Avenir Next, Avenir, Segoe
        UI, system-ui at 15px and 1.6. The headline is 64px with an italic
        moon coloured Saturday, figures 40px, section titles 28px italic,
        room names 21px, the kicker 12px caps with 0.32em tracking.
    layout:
        A night sky fading from deep blue at the top to near black holds
        about ninety faint star dots in its upper half. The hero pairs a
        kicker line with the home name, day and time, the headline A quiet
        Saturday night and a line saying Movie is on and the bedroom cools
        to 18, with a pale waxing gibbous moon in a soft glow on the right.
        A pill shaped alert outlined in dusky brown has a triangle, the
        garage sentence and a moon coloured Close now. Today's energy tide
        follows with three serif figures and a full width tide line, a
        smooth pale blue curve over a gradient water fill with a faint
        dotted second wave, a horizon rule, hour labels, a filled triangle
        for high and an outlined triangle for low, then a tide table listing
        high, low and now ebbing. Below, Rooms tonight lists the five rooms
        in ruled rows with a coloured icon, serif name, italic note, the
        value and a small caps state word such as Lit, Dark, Cooling, Locked
        and Motion. Scenes show as moon phase cards, new moon for Good
        night, full for Movie with a check and Full now, crescent for Away
        and first quarter for Morning. Below 900px rooms and scenes stack,
        and at phone width the moon moves above the headline at 120px.
    spacing: An 8px unit with wide 40 to 48px gaps between bands and 14px row padding.
    density: Low. Hero, tide, rooms and phases read top to bottom.
    corners: Full pills for the alert and buttons, 24px phase cards and round swatches.
    borders: 1px #253058 rules between rooms and a moon coloured edge on the active phase.
    shadows: None. A soft glow ring around the moon only.
    icons: Thin 1.5 stroke line icons beside rooms, and moon phase discs for scenes, each with a phase name.
    focus: A 2px moon outline offset 4px.
    tone: Quiet and poetic, such as A quiet Saturday night, Today's energy tide, high and ebbing.
